# machine-specific absolute symlink to the jamovi checkout — recreate with:
#   ln -s /path/to/jamovi-src tools/jamovi-src
jamovi-src

# Local-only maintainer material. The rest of tools/ is tracked and shipped
# with the repo (same as every other module); these four are not:
#   update_and_test.sh   pulls the jamovi source forward and rebuilds the
#                        docker image -- needs a jamovi-src checkout that is
#                        not part of this repo, so a cloner cannot run it
#   haplo_standalone.R   validates the haplotype results against the web tool
#   SNPStats-sample3.html  329 KB of captured reference output behind the
#                        golden values; nothing in tests/ reads it
update_and_test.sh
haplo_standalone.R
SNPStats-sample3.html
